/* Cocaine — zh-Hant: SSH hosts (AI agents on remote machines, through the user's own ssh) */

"A Host from ~/.ssh/config, or user@host (with :port if needed). Nothing is connected until you install the relay." = "~/.ssh/config 中的 Host，或 user@host（需要時加 :連接埠）。安裝中繼之前不會連線任何東西。";
"Add an SSH host" = "加入 SSH 主機";
"Add host…" = "加入主機…";
"Another host…" = "其他主機…";
"Brought %@ forward: the tab with that ssh connection wasn't found (opened from another app, a jump host, or a background connection)." = "已將 %@ 移到最前面：找不到該 ssh 連線所在的分頁（由其他 App、跳板主機或背景連線開啟）。";
"Can't add that host" = "無法加入該主機";
"Can't reach it: unknown host name." = "無法連線：未知的主機名稱。";
"Can't reach it." = "無法連線。";
"Change these files" = "變更這些檔案";
"Check hooks…" = "檢查掛鉤…";
"Cocaine copies one small script (perl) and a key into ~/.cocaine there, through your own ssh. Nothing else changes and no port is opened. The AI tools' settings there change only after you review them." = "Cocaine 透過你自己的 ssh，把一個小腳本（perl）和一把金鑰複製到對方的 ~/.cocaine。其他一切不變，也不會開啟任何連接埠。對方的 AI 工具設定只會在你檢查之後才變更。";
"Cocaine runs /usr/bin/ssh with your ~/.ssh/config and keys, host keys always checked, nothing forwarded" = "Cocaine 使用你的 ~/.ssh/config 和金鑰執行 /usr/bin/ssh，一律檢查主機金鑰，不轉送任何東西";
"Cocaine runs on that machine itself: its own hooks are left alone." = "那台機器上執行的就是 Cocaine：不會更動它自己的掛鉤。";
"Codex asks to trust new hooks once: run /hooks in Codex there." = "Codex 會要求信任一次新掛鉤：請在對方的 Codex 中執行 /hooks。";
"Connect to %@" = "連線到 %@";
"Connect to the host first, or remove it from Cocaine only." = "請先連線到該主機，或僅從 Cocaine 中移除。";
"Connect to the host first." = "請先連線到該主機。";
"Connected · hooks: %@" = "已連線 · 掛鉤：%@";
"Connected · no hooks there yet" = "已連線 · 尚無掛鉤";
"Couldn't be read: left alone." = "無法讀取：保持原樣。";
"Couldn't keep the host's key in the Keychain." = "無法將主機金鑰儲存到鑰匙圈。";
"Follow AI agents on SSH hosts" = "追蹤 SSH 主機上的 AI 代理";
"From your ~/.ssh/config and known_hosts (only read):" = "來自你的 ~/.ssh/config 和 known_hosts（僅讀取）：";
"Hooks added there." = "已在對方加入掛鉤。";
"Hooks removed there." = "已在對方移除掛鉤。";
"host unreachable" = "主機無法連線";
"Install relay…" = "安裝中繼…";
"Install the relay on %@?" = "要在 %@ 上安裝中繼嗎？";
"Installing the relay…" = "正在安裝中繼…";
"It isn't connected: its hooks and ~/.cocaine stay there until you remove them (rm -rf ~/.cocaine, and Cocaine's lines in the AI tools' settings)." = "未連線：它的掛鉤和 ~/.cocaine 會留在對方，直到你自行移除（rm -rf ~/.cocaine，以及 AI 工具設定中 Cocaine 的行）。";
"Letters, digits and . _ @ : - only" = "僅限字母、數字和 . _ @ : -";
"Log" = "記錄";
"Log in in Terminal" = "在終端機中登入";
"new file" = "新檔案";
"Not a host name ssh can be given." = "不是可以交給 ssh 的主機名稱。";
"Not a JSON file Cocaine can edit safely: left alone." = "不是 Cocaine 能安全編輯的 JSON 檔案：保持原樣。";
"Not now" = "以後再說";
"Nothing Cocaine can change there." = "Cocaine 在那裡沒有可變更的內容。";
"Nothing to change: the hooks there are up to date." = "無需變更：對方的掛鉤已是最新。";
"Nothing was changed there (%@)." = "對方未做任何變更（%@）。";
"Off (all SSH hosts)" = "已關閉（所有 SSH 主機）";
"Only Cocaine's own lines go; everything else in those files stays. A backup is kept in ~/.cocaine/backup there." = "只移除 Cocaine 自己的行，這些檔案中的其他內容保持不變。對方的 ~/.cocaine/backup 中會保留備份。";
"Reading the AI tools' settings there…" = "正在讀取 AI 工具的設定…";
"Relay installed." = "中繼已安裝。";
"Relay not installed yet" = "尚未安裝中繼";
"Remove %@?" = "要移除 %@ 嗎？";
"Remove Cocaine's hooks on %@?" = "要移除 %@ 上 Cocaine 的掛鉤嗎？";
"Remove from Cocaine only" = "僅從 Cocaine 中移除";
"Remove hooks" = "移除掛鉤";
"Remove, and take Cocaine off the host" = "移除，並從主機上撤下 Cocaine";
"Review hooks…" = "檢查掛鉤…";
"Shows what would change in the AI tools' settings there, before anything is written" = "在寫入任何內容之前，顯示對方 AI 工具設定中將會變更的內容";
"SSH hosts" = "SSH 主機";
"SSH hosts: %d of %d connected" = "SSH 主機：已連線 %d / %d";
"Taking Cocaine off the host removes its hooks there and ~/.cocaine." = "從主機上撤下 Cocaine 會移除對方的掛鉤和 ~/.cocaine。";
"That host has no perl with JSON::PP and Digest::SHA, which the relay needs." = "該主機沒有中繼所需、附 JSON::PP 和 Digest::SHA 的 perl。";
"That host is already in the list." = "該主機已在列表中。";
"The connection was lost." = "連線已中斷。";
"The host didn't answer." = "主機沒有回應。";
"The host isn't connected: nothing was changed." = "主機未連線：未做任何變更。";
"The host's key has CHANGED since it was trusted: Cocaine won't connect. If you expected it, update ~/.ssh/known_hosts in Terminal." = "主機金鑰自受信任以來已變更：Cocaine 不會連線。如果這在你的預期之中，請在終端機中更新 ~/.ssh/known_hosts。";
"The list is full." = "列表已滿。";
"The login was refused (key, ssh agent or MFA). Log in once in Terminal, or check your key." = "登入遭拒（金鑰、ssh 代理或 MFA）。請在終端機中登入一次，或檢查你的金鑰。";
"The relay couldn't be removed there." = "無法移除對方的中繼。";
"The relay isn't on that host." = "該主機上沒有中繼。";
"The relay there has another key: install it again." = "對方的中繼使用的是另一把金鑰：請重新安裝。";
"The terminal with that ssh connection wasn't found on this Mac." = "在這台 Mac 上找不到該 ssh 連線所在的終端機。";
"These files on %@ would change:" = "%@ 上的下列檔案將會變更：";
"This host's key isn't in ~/.ssh/known_hosts yet: connect once in Terminal to check and accept it." = "該主機的金鑰尚未在 ~/.ssh/known_hosts 中：請在終端機中連線一次，以檢查並接受它。";
"Through your own ssh: alerts, plans, questions and approvals in the notch. No port is opened; each host only after your OK." = "透過你自己的 ssh：在瀏海中處理提醒、計畫、問題和核准。不開啟任何連接埠；每台主機都需經你同意。";
"Unreachable: trying again at %@" = "無法連線：將於 %@ 重試";
"Updating the relay…" = "正在更新中繼…";
"user@host or a config Host" = "user@host 或 config 中的 Host";
"What was done on each host, when (never any content)" = "在每台主機上何時做了什麼（從不記錄內容）";
"Working…" = "處理中…";
